#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.max.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.max"
msgstr "cuda.tile.max"

#: cuda.tile._stub.max:1 of
msgid "Performs max reduction on tile along the `axis`."
msgstr "沿指定轴对 Tile 执行最大值归约。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.max.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.max:3 of
msgid "input tile."
msgstr "输入 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.max:5 of
msgid ""
"the axis for reduction. The default, `axis=None`, will reduce all of the "
"elements. For `argmin` and `argmax`, tuple of axis is not supported."
msgstr "要执行归约的轴。默认值 ``axis=None`` 表示归约所有元素。对于 ``argmin`` 和 ``argmax`` ，不支持传入轴元组。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.max:9 of
msgid ""
"If true, preserves the number of dimension from the input tile. "
"flush_to_zero (const bool): If True, flushes subnormal inputs and results"
" to sign-preserving zero, default is False. propagate_nan (const bool): "
"Float types only. If False (the default), NaN inputs are ignored. If "
"True, NaN propagates: a NaN makes the result NaN for min/max, and "
"argmin/argmax return the index of the first NaN."
msgstr ""
"若为 True，则在输出中保留与输入 Tile 相同的维度数。 ``flush_to_zero`` (const bool)：若为 "
"True，则将次正规（subnormal）输入和结果刷零（保留符号），默认为 False。 ``propagate_nan`` (const "
"bool)：仅适用于浮点类型。若为 False（默认值），则忽略 NaN 输入；若为 True，则传播 NaN：对于 ``min`` / "
"``max`` ，输入中的 NaN 会使结果为 NaN，而 ``argmin`` / ``argmax`` 会返回第一个 NaN 的索引。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.max.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile._stub.max:15 of
msgid ""
".. rubric:: Examples  Reduce all axes.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.max(tx, None))  .. "
"testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]     reduced: 7  "
"Reduce axis 1 and keepdims.  .. testcode::     :template: "
"kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 4))"
"     print(\"input:\", tx)     print(\"reduced:\", ct.max(tx, 1, "
"keepdims=True))  .. testoutput::      input: [[0, 1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6, 7]]"
"     reduced: [[3], [7]]  Reduce axes (1, 2).  .. testcode::     "
":template: kernel_wrapper.py      tx = ct.arange(8, "
"dtype=ct.int32).reshape((2, 2, 2))     print(\"input:\", tx)     "
"print(\"reduced:\", ct.max(tx, (1, 2)))  .. testoutput::      input: "
"[[[0, 1], [2, 3]], [[4, 5], [6, 7]]]     reduced: [3, 7]"
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile._stub.max of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

